    <origin>Route authorization sweep (notes/route-authorization-sweep-2026-10-02.md, workflow run wf_c2daa097-2f4): eleven verified findings on the Communications surface (sweep rows 7, 8, 33, 34, 35, 58, 59, 60, 61, 62, 79), evidence in the session scratchpad file idor-group-161.json. Owner round 9 (notes/session27-owner-decisions-and-research.md, 2026-10-03, BINDING): UAC-r2 fixes all 82 findings now, including surfaces other projects own, with one access-control pattern. One more leak is folded in: the Office suggestions route still returns candidate record ids the caller cannot read (Api/Office/CommunicationsEndpoints.cs:397; sweep "noteworthy" line, workspace-misc slice), which task 127's acceptance criterion said it had closed.</origin>
