    <patterns>
      <pattern name="per-route resource declaration in one filter" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs">Each route declares the id it authorizes, where the id comes from (route value or bound body), the entity set and the right; the filter asks as the caller and fails closed.</pattern>
