    <criterion testable="true">POST /api/communications/accounts/{id:guid}/verify: a caller without Write on the sprk_communicationaccount record → the byte-identical ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND 404 a non-existent id gets, the Graph client factory's ForApp() is never invoked and no sprk_communicationaccount update is made; a caller with Write → 200 as today.</criterion>
